 redemption, but her motives are shrouded in secrecy.  As Gareth fights for his honor, he must confront not only his enemies but also the demons of his past.',	'poster_4.png',	'{"title":"A Knights Tarnished Honor","runtime_mins":94,"genres":"Action, Adventure, Historical, Fantasy","rating":"4.7","released":2017,"actors":"Tiffany Ho,  Wong Mei Ling","director":"Ayaan Mishra","plot":"Sir Gareth, a renowned knight, is stripped of his title and banished after being falsely accused of treason.  Haunted by the shame and desperate to clear his name, he embarks on a perilous quest to uncover the truth, facing treacherous landscapes and even more treacherous enemies.  Along the way, he encounters a mysterious woman who holds the key to his redemption, but her motives are shrouded in secrecy.  As Gareth fights for his honor, he must confront not only his enemies but also the demons of his past."}'),
