d of espionage and deception, uncovering a web of lies that reaches the highest levels of power.  Their only hope lies in cracking the final code before it''s too late.',	'poster_306.png',	'{"actors":"Wong Mei Ling,  Hassan Nasrallah,  Harry Brown","director":"Mariana Silva","genres":"Thriller, Spy","plot":"A brilliant but reclusive codebreaker, forced out of retirement, must decipher a cryptic message hidden within a seemingly innocuous children''s book.  The message reveals a sinister plot to destabilize global economies, and the codebreaker must race against time to expose the mastermind behind it.  With the help of a young, tech-savvy hacker, they navigate a dangerous world of espionage and deception, uncovering a web of lies that reaches the highest levels of power.  Their only hope lies in cracking the final code before it''s too late.","rating":"2.9","released":2003,"runtime_mins":101,"title":"The Spy Code"}'),
