ime running out, The Agent must race against the clock to clear his name and expose the truth, even if it means sacrificing everything he holds dear.',	'poster_307.png',	'{"actors":"Aryan Verma,  Chow Wai Kin,  Emma Ferreira","director":"Rajeev Choudhury","genres":"Spy, Thriller","plot":"A seasoned spy, known only as \"The Agent,\" is forced to confront his past when a mysterious package arrives on his doorstep, containing a cryptic message and a list of his former targets. As he delves deeper into the conspiracy, he uncovers a web of betrayal and deceit that threatens to expose his true identity and unravel his carefully constructed life.  With time running out, The Agent must race against the clock to clear his name and expose the truth, even if it means sacrificing everything he holds dear.","rating":"4.2","released":2014,"runtime_mins":155,"title":"The Agents Eulogy"}'),
