 or succumb to the darkness that threatens to consume him.  The line between right and wrong blurs as he fights for redemption, but at what cost?',	'poster_309.png',	'{"actors":"Emily Chan,  Leung Ho Yin,  Naima Said","director":"Prisha Menon","genres":"Action, Thriller","plot":"A seasoned secret agent, betrayed and left for dead by his own agency, vows revenge.  He embarks on a perilous mission to expose the corrupt officials responsible for his downfall, using his skills and cunning to dismantle their network from within.  As he uncovers a conspiracy that reaches the highest levels of power, he must confront his past and make a choice: seek justice or succumb to the darkness that threatens to consume him.  The line between right and wrong blurs as he fights for redemption, but at what cost?","rating":"1.1","released":2001,"runtime_mins":195,"title":"An Agents Revenge"}'),
