edemption in the face of unimaginable danger.  His vow to protect his family becomes a desperate battle for survival, testing the limits of his courage and forcing him to confront the true meaning of sacrifice.',	'poster_17.png',	'{"title":"A Soldiers Vow","runtime_mins":61,"genres":"Action, Thriller","rating":"1.4","released":2012,"actors":"Brandon Chow","director":"Emiliano Ramirez","plot":"A decorated soldier, haunted by the horrors of war, returns home to a life he no longer recognizes.  He struggles to reconnect with his family and find peace, but a mysterious threat from his past resurfaces, forcing him to confront his demons and make a life-altering choice.  As he fights to protect his loved ones, he must decide whether to embrace the darkness that consumed him or find redemption in the face of unimaginable danger.  His vow to protect his family becomes a desperate battle for survival, testing the limits of his courage and forcing him to confront the true meaning of sacrifice."}'),
