ng with the ethical implications of her own creation and the potential consequences of altering the past.  In a thrilling climax, Evelyn confronts Blackwood in a battle that will determine the fate of humanity and the very fabric of time itself.',	'',	'{"actors":"Shirin Ebadi,  Nguyen Van Minh","director":"Elijah Foster","genres":"Action, Thriller","plot":"A brilliant but reclusive scientist, Dr. Evelyn Thorne, discovers a way to manipulate time, but her invention falls into the wrong hands.  A ruthless corporation, led by the enigmatic Mr. Blackwood, seeks to exploit the technology for their own gain, threatening to rewrite history and reshape the world.  Evelyn must race against time to stop Blackwood, while grappling with the ethical implications of her own creation and the potential consequences of altering the past.  In a thrilling climax, Evelyn confronts Blackwood in a battle that will determine the fate of humanity and the very fabric of time itself.","rating":"2.8","released":2020,"runtime_mins":62,"title":"Endgame"}'),
