as found.  The choice he makes will determine his fate and the legacy of his poetry.',	'poster_24.png',	'{"title":"A Poets Woe","runtime_mins":82,"genres":"Drama, Thriller","rating":"3.3","released":2005,"actors":"Leung Ho Yin,  Leonie Becker","director":"David Hoffmann","plot":"A struggling poet, haunted by the tragic loss of his muse, finds solace in a mysterious woman who inspires him to write again.  But as their connection deepens, he discovers a dark secret about her past that threatens to destroy everything he holds dear.  Forced to confront his own demons and the woman''s hidden truth, he must choose between his art and the love he has found.  The choice he makes will determine his fate and the legacy of his poetry."}'),
