of hope and a profound question about the true meaning of sacrifice.  The film explores the emotional journey of Emily and her daughter, as they grapple with the weight of her decision and the enduring power of love.',	'poster_315.png',	'{"actors":"Emma Bernard,  Ng Wai Man","director":"David Hoffmann","genres":"Drama, Thriller","plot":"A renowned scientist, Dr. Emily Carter, discovers a cure for a deadly pandemic, but it comes at a devastating cost: she must sacrifice her own life to activate the cure.  Torn between her desire to save humanity and her fear of leaving her young daughter behind, Emily faces an impossible choice.  As the world watches, she makes a heart-wrenching decision, leaving behind a legacy of hope and a profound question about the true meaning of sacrifice.  The film explores the emotional journey of Emily and her daughter, as they grapple with the weight of her decision and the enduring power of love.","rating":"3.2","released":2006,"runtime_mins":88,"title":"A Noble Sacrifice"}'),
