riend and foe blurs, and the spy must confront his own demons to complete his final mission.',	'poster_318.png',	'{"actors":"Andrew Lam","director":"Amari Diallo","genres":"Action, Spy, Thriller","plot":"A seasoned spy, haunted by past failures, is tasked with one final mission: to infiltrate a heavily guarded fortress and retrieve a stolen weapon of mass destruction.  However, he soon discovers a betrayal within the agency, forcing him to question his loyalties and fight for survival.  As the clock ticks down, he must race against time to expose the traitor and prevent global catastrophe.  The line between friend and foe blurs, and the spy must confront his own demons to complete his final mission.","rating":"2.7","released":2019,"runtime_mins":170,"title":"Final Mission"}'),
