truth about the origins of their society and the true nature of their dreams.  Anya must choose between the comfort of a controlled reality and the uncertain promise of a future where dreams are truly free.',	'poster_48.png',	'{"title":"Dreams of Tomorrow","runtime_mins":55,"genres":"Action, Sci-Fi","rating":"1.5","released":2018,"actors":"Samir Hassan","director":"Aigerim Abilkasymova","plot":"In a dystopian future where dreams are controlled by a powerful corporation, a young woman named Anya discovers she can access forbidden memories through her dreams.  Driven by a desire for freedom and truth, she teams up with a group of rebels who fight to break free from the corporation''s control.  As they delve deeper into the secrets of the past, they uncover a shocking truth about the origins of their society and the true nature of their dreams.  Anya must choose between the comfort of a controlled reality and the uncertain promise of a future where dreams are truly free."}'),
