tradition and the pursuit of truth.  Her journey leads her to a profound understanding of faith, not as a rigid dogma, but as a personal and evolving connection to something greater.',	'poster_55.png',	'{"title":"Challenging the Faith","runtime_mins":156,"genres":"Drama, Thriller","rating":"2.5","released":2008,"actors":"Isabella Johnson,  Caoimhe OSullivan,  Camila Sánchez","director":"Sonali Chatterjee","plot":"A devout young woman, raised in a strict religious community, begins to question her faith after witnessing a series of inexplicable events.  As she delves deeper into her doubts, she faces ostracism from her community and the threat of losing everything she holds dear.  Forced to confront her own beliefs and the power of faith, she must choose between the comfort of tradition and the pursuit of truth.  Her journey leads her to a profound understanding of faith, not as a rigid dogma, but as a personal and evolving connection to something greater."}'),
