 client''s innocence or expose the truth, even if it means sacrificing his career and reputation.  The courtroom becomes a battleground where truth and justice are tested, and the attorney''s own conscience is put on trial.',	'poster_63.png',	'{"title":"The Counsels Plea","runtime_mins":143,"genres":"Thriller, Drama","rating":"4.3","released":2004,"actors":"Benjamín Morales,  Camila Sánchez,  Vihaan Kapoor","director":"Sophie Müller","plot":"A brilliant but jaded defense attorney, known for winning impossible cases, takes on a seemingly open-and-shut murder trial. As he delves deeper into the case, he uncovers a web of secrets and lies, forcing him to question everything he thought he knew about his client and the justice system.  Driven by a moral dilemma and a growing sense of doubt, he must decide whether to fight for his client''s innocence or expose the truth, even if it means sacrificing his career and reputation.  The courtroom becomes a battleground where truth and justice are tested, and the attorney''s own conscience is put on trial."}'),
