ipated, leading the jesters to fight for their lives and the kingdom''s sanity.',	'poster_74.png',	'{"title":"Jesters Prank","runtime_mins":54,"genres":"Comedy, Action","rating":"1.6","released":2011,"actors":"Francesco Costa,  David Ma,  Emma Murphy","director":"Amina Mohamed","plot":"A group of mischievous jesters, known for their elaborate pranks, decide to target the pompous King Bartholomew. Their elaborate scheme involves a series of increasingly outrageous gags, culminating in a grand finale that exposes the King''s vanity and forces him to confront his own flaws. However, their prank goes awry when the King''s reaction is far more dangerous than they anticipated, leading the jesters to fight for their lives and the kingdom''s sanity."}'),
