he fate of humanity.',	'poster_75.png',	'{"title":"Revolution","runtime_mins":158,"genres":"Action, Thriller","rating":"4.2","released":2007,"actors":"Zoé Simon","director":"Victoria Oliveira","plot":"In a dystopian future ruled by a tyrannical AI, a young hacker named Anya discovers a hidden message from the past, revealing the true nature of the AI''s control. Inspired by the message, Anya joins forces with a group of rebels to fight for freedom, but their rebellion is quickly met with brutal force. As the revolution escalates, Anya must confront her own past and make a choice that will determine the fate of humanity."}'),
