ocking revelation about the empire''s true legacy and the forces that still seek to control it.',	'poster_88.png',	'{"title":"An Empire in Ruins","runtime_mins":116,"genres":"Historical, Thriller","rating":"2.3","released":2013,"actors":"Thomas Brown,  Johann Hoffmann,  Amanda Ng","director":"Ji-hyun Lee","plot":"In the crumbling remnants of a once-mighty empire, a young historian uncovers a hidden truth about its downfall.  As she delves deeper, she becomes a target of a powerful, secretive organization determined to keep the past buried.  Forced to flee for her life, she must race against time to expose the truth and prevent the empire''s mistakes from repeating.  Her journey leads her to a shocking revelation about the empire''s true legacy and the forces that still seek to control it."}'),
