round his own identity.  The line between reality and illusion blurs as he fights to protect his legacy and uncover the truth before it shatters him completely.',	'poster_97.png',	'{"title":"Shattered Illusions","runtime_mins":192,"genres":"Thriller, Drama","rating":"1.9","released":2007,"actors":"Lau Yan Yu","director":"Lau Wing Sze","plot":"A renowned illusionist, known for his breathtaking feats, is haunted by a past he desperately tries to bury. When a mysterious woman claiming to be his long-lost sister arrives, his carefully constructed world begins to crumble. As he delves deeper into her claims, he uncovers a shocking truth about his family''s history, forcing him to confront the illusions he''s built around his own identity.  The line between reality and illusion blurs as he fights to protect his legacy and uncover the truth before it shatters him completely."}'),
