n dark secret.',	'poster_108.png',	'{"title":"Guilts Burden","runtime_mins":142,"genres":"Thriller, Drama","rating":"1.4","released":2016,"actors":"Noah Schulz","director":"Teina Brown","plot":"A successful lawyer, haunted by a past mistake that led to a wrongful conviction, finds himself defending a man accused of a similar crime. As he delves deeper into the case, he uncovers a web of corruption and realizes his own guilt is inextricably linked to the present.  Driven by a desperate need for redemption, he must confront his past and fight for justice, even if it means exposing his own dark secret."}'),
