',	'{"title":"A Past Erased","runtime_mins":175,"genres":"Thriller, Drama","rating":"4.6","released":2015,"actors":"Xavier Butler,  Leonie Becker","director":"Sarah Cheung","plot":"A brilliant scientist, haunted by a traumatic past, invents a device that can erase memories. He uses it on himself, hoping to escape his pain, but soon discovers that erasing the bad also erases the good, leaving him a hollow shell of his former self.  Desperate to reclaim his life, he must race against time to undo the damage before he loses everything, including the love of his life."}'),
