 reaction, forcing those closest to him to grapple with the true meaning of sacrifice and the weight of his legacy.  In the end, the line between hero and villain blurs, leaving the audience to question the ultimate cost of redemption.',	'poster_336.png',	'{"actors":"Oskar Braun,  Julian Sanders,  Justin Leung","director":"Ian Bell","genres":"Thriller, Drama","plot":"A brilliant but reclusive scientist, driven by a desire to save humanity from a deadly pandemic, discovers a cure but realizes it requires a sacrifice he never anticipated.  As the world teeters on the brink of collapse, he must confront his own mortality and make an impossible choice: save himself or the millions he''s sworn to protect.  His decision sets off a chain reaction, forcing those closest to him to grapple with the true meaning of sacrifice and the weight of his legacy.  In the end, the line between hero and villain blurs, leaving the audience to question the ultimate cost of redemption.","rating":"4.6","released":2022,"runtime_mins":97,"title":"The Ultimate Sacrifice"}'),
