nces, and unexpected twists unfold as they navigate treacherous landscapes and dangerous situations, ultimately discovering that the real treasure lies within.  In the end, only one will claim the ultimate reward, but the journey itself becomes the greatest prize.',	'poster_338.png',	'{"actors":"Lucía Castillo,  Oscar Wagner","director":"Varun Kapoor","genres":"Adventure, Thriller","plot":"A reclusive billionaire, obsessed with finding the ultimate reward, leaves cryptic clues in his will, leading a group of diverse strangers on a thrilling scavenger hunt across the globe.  As they race against time and each other, they uncover hidden truths about themselves and the true nature of the reward, which is not what they expected.  Betrayal, alliances, and unexpected twists unfold as they navigate treacherous landscapes and dangerous situations, ultimately discovering that the real treasure lies within.  In the end, only one will claim the ultimate reward, but the journey itself becomes the greatest prize.","rating":"4.3","released":2012,"runtime_mins":151,"title":"The Ultimate Reward"}'),
