unrequited love.  Amelia must now find the strength to move on, rediscovering her own voice and embracing the possibility of love in unexpected forms.',	'poster_122.png',	'{"title":"Love Unreturned","runtime_mins":188,"genres":"drama, romance","rating":"4.5","released":2007,"actors":"Sofia Bianchi","director":"Ayaan Mishra","plot":"A talented but shy musician, Amelia, pours her heart into her music, hoping to capture the attention of her enigmatic neighbor, Ethan.  Ethan, however, is oblivious to her affections, caught up in his own world of artistic pursuits.  When Amelia finally gathers the courage to confess her feelings, Ethan reveals a secret that shatters her hopes and forces her to confront the painful reality of unrequited love.  Amelia must now find the strength to move on, rediscovering her own voice and embracing the possibility of love in unexpected forms."}'),
