ing truth that lies hidden within the silence.  The line between reality and delusion blurs, leaving the audience questioning who is truly the victim and who is the tormentor.',	'poster_124.png',	'{"title":"Agony in Silence","runtime_mins":197,"genres":"Horror, Thriller","rating":"4.5","released":2004,"actors":"Léa Moreau,  Jayden Begay","director":"Martín Acosta","plot":"A young woman, haunted by a traumatic past, finds solace in the quiet solitude of her remote cabin.  However, her peace is shattered when a mysterious stranger arrives, bringing with him a chilling secret that threatens to unravel her fragile sanity.  As the stranger''s presence intensifies, the woman must confront her deepest fears and fight to survive the agonizing truth that lies hidden within the silence.  The line between reality and delusion blurs, leaving the audience questioning who is truly the victim and who is the tormentor."}'),
