calypse and reclaim her birthright.',	'poster_342.png',	'{"actors":"Charlotte Weber,  Cheung Wai Kin","director":"Mia Acosta","genres":"Fantasy, Action","plot":"A young woman, haunted by visions of a fallen angel, discovers she is the last descendant of a lineage tasked with protecting humanity from demonic forces. As she unravels the secrets of her past, she must confront her own inner demons and choose between her destiny and the life she thought she knew.  With the help of a mysterious angel warrior, she embarks on a perilous journey to stop the apocalypse and reclaim her birthright.","rating":"1.5","released":2024,"runtime_mins":80,"title":"Fallen Angel Chronicles"}'),
