justice and protecting his family from the consequences of his actions.  In the end, he learns that the price of betrayal is far greater than he ever imagined.',	'poster_129.png',	'{"title":"Betrayals Cost","runtime_mins":96,"genres":"Thriller, Drama","rating":"5.0","released":2005,"actors":"Andrew Lam,  Katherine Morris,  Lauren Cook","director":"Nicole Kelly","plot":"A successful businessman, David, discovers his trusted business partner, Mark, has been embezzling funds for years.  Driven by a thirst for revenge, David sets out to expose Mark''s crimes, but his pursuit leads him down a dangerous path, forcing him to confront the true cost of his own betrayals.  As the lines between right and wrong blur, David must choose between seeking justice and protecting his family from the consequences of his actions.  In the end, he learns that the price of betrayal is far greater than he ever imagined."}'),
