er imagined.',	'poster_135.png',	'{"title":"Forgiveness Price","runtime_mins":114,"genres":"Thriller, Drama","rating":"4.8","released":2007,"actors":"Giulia Ferrari,  Parth Chopra","director":"Mohamed Salah","plot":"A hardened detective, haunted by a past mistake that cost him his family, is forced to confront his demons when a new case leads him to the very person he swore to bring down. As he delves deeper into the investigation, he uncovers a web of secrets and lies, forcing him to choose between seeking justice and finding redemption.  The price of forgiveness, however, may be higher than he ever imagined."}'),
