omes trapped in a never-ending loop of her own creation.  The only way to save herself and the world is to confront her younger self and convince her to abandon her dangerous ambition.',	'poster_356.png',	'{"actors":"Miriam Makeba,  Lucy Nolan,  Hugo Lambert","director":"Sara Monti","genres":"Thriller, Sci-Fi","plot":"A brilliant but reckless scientist, Dr. Ava Sharma, invents a time travel device, but her first test goes horribly wrong.  She accidentally sends her younger self back in time, creating a paradox that threatens to unravel the fabric of reality.  Now, Ava must race against time to fix her mistake before the past and present collide, and she becomes trapped in a never-ending loop of her own creation.  The only way to save herself and the world is to confront her younger self and convince her to abandon her dangerous ambition.","rating":"2.8","released":2002,"runtime_mins":138,"title":"Time Travelers Paradox"}'),
