 the truth unravels, Goldie must decide whether to protect her client or expose the dangerous secrets that threaten to destroy them both.',	'poster_184.png',	'{"title":"Goldie the Therapist","runtime_mins":40,"genres":"Thriller, Drama","rating":"3.5","released":2006,"actors":"Victoria Bailey,  Isaiah Reed,  Miguel Ángel Santos","director":"Anushka Roy","plot":"Goldie, a quirky and unconventional therapist, struggles to balance her own personal demons with helping her eccentric clients. When a mysterious new patient arrives with a shocking secret, Goldie''s life takes a dramatic turn, forcing her to confront her own past and the blurred lines between therapist and patient. As the truth unravels, Goldie must decide whether to protect her client or expose the dangerous secrets that threaten to destroy them both."}'),
