tanist must find a way to save the orchid and its magical properties, while also confronting their own fears of connection and vulnerability.',	'poster_203.png',	'{"title":"Floral Whisperer","runtime_mins":195,"genres":"Fantasy, Thriller","rating":"3.5","released":2002,"actors":"Lau Wing Sze,  Samuel Fernandes","director":"Mia Jones","plot":"A reclusive botanist, known as the \"Floral Whisperer,\" discovers a rare orchid rumored to grant wishes. When a greedy developer threatens to destroy the orchid''s habitat, the botanist must choose between protecting the flower and revealing its secret, risking the wrath of those who seek its power.  As the developer''s greed intensifies, the botanist must find a way to save the orchid and its magical properties, while also confronting their own fears of connection and vulnerability."}'),
