against time to undo her mistakes and restore the timeline before it''s too late.  But with each journey, she faces a crucial choice: to observe or intervene, and the consequences of her decisions will forever change the world.',	'poster_26.png',	'{"title":"A Fork in History","runtime_mins":153,"genres":"Action, Adventure, Thriller, Historical, Fantasy","rating":"2.9","released":2001,"actors":"Caoimhe OSullivan","director":"Ho Ho Yin","plot":"A brilliant but eccentric historian, Dr. Amelia Grant, discovers a hidden artifact that allows her to travel through time.  Driven by a desire to witness history firsthand, she embarks on a thrilling journey to pivotal moments in the past, but her actions inadvertently alter the course of history, leading to a dystopian future.  Now, Amelia must race against time to undo her mistakes and restore the timeline before it''s too late.  But with each journey, she faces a crucial choice: to observe or intervene, and the consequences of her decisions will forever change the world."}'),
