urage.  In the face of overwhelming odds, they discover that even the most ordinary people can become extraordinary warriors.',	'poster_42.png',	'{"title":"Warriors Way","runtime_mins":143,"genres":"Action, Adventure","rating":"4.6","released":2004,"actors":"Ananya Sharma,  Mei Zhang","director":"Benjamin Schulz","plot":"A legendary warrior, exiled from his homeland, finds refuge in a small, peaceful American town.  He must confront his past when a ruthless warlord arrives seeking revenge, forcing him to choose between his newfound peace and the duty to protect the innocent.  As the town becomes a battleground, the warrior must teach the townspeople to fight for themselves, embracing their own inner strength and courage.  In the face of overwhelming odds, they discover that even the most ordinary people can become extraordinary warriors."}'),
