ocking discovery about the original patient''s fate, forcing him to make a life-altering decision.  The film explores themes of redemption, forgiveness, and the enduring power of human connection.',	'poster_92.png',	'{"title":"Scarred","runtime_mins":120,"genres":"Drama, Thriller","rating":"2.4","released":2010,"actors":"Katherine Simmons,  Isabella Ferrari,  Aoife Murphy","director":"Nicole Martinez","plot":"A brilliant but reclusive surgeon, haunted by a past medical error that left a patient permanently scarred, is forced to confront his demons when a new patient arrives with a similar condition. As he struggles to save the patient''s life, he must also confront the guilt and shame that have consumed him for years.  His journey leads him to a shocking discovery about the original patient''s fate, forcing him to make a life-altering decision.  The film explores themes of redemption, forgiveness, and the enduring power of human connection."}'),
