e the killer before it''s too late.',	'poster_100.png',	'{"title":"A Silent Plea","runtime_mins":49,"genres":"Thriller, Drama","rating":"1.3","released":2006,"actors":"Caleb Cook,  Diya Singh","director":"Ho Ho Yin","plot":"A young woman, mute since childhood, witnesses a brutal crime.  Unable to speak, she must find a way to communicate the truth to the police, battling both her own fear and the skepticism of those who doubt her silent plea.  As the investigation intensifies, she uncovers a web of secrets and lies, putting her own life in danger.  With the help of a compassionate detective, she must race against time to expose the killer before it''s too late."}'),
