 threatens to tear them apart forever.  Will their love be strong enough to overcome the obstacles of time and fate?',	'poster_116.png',	'{"title":"Eternal Love","runtime_mins":130,"genres":"Romance, Fantasy","rating":"4.4","released":2000,"actors":"Isabella Castro,  Camila Almeida","director":"Mia Jones","plot":"In a world where souls are reborn into new lives, a young woman named Anya discovers she has been in love with the same man, Liam, for centuries.  Haunted by fragmented memories of their past lives, they must navigate the complexities of their present relationship while unraveling the mystery of their eternal bond.  As they delve deeper into their shared history, they face a powerful force that threatens to tear them apart forever.  Will their love be strong enough to overcome the obstacles of time and fate?"}'),
