s he delves deeper into the conspiracy, he uncovers a web of deceit and discovers that the true price of loyalty is far greater than he ever imagined.',	'poster_123.png',	'{"title":"Loyaltys Price","runtime_mins":123,"genres":"Thriller, Action","rating":"2.1","released":2002,"actors":"Evan Perry,  Waleed Aly,  Camille Durand","director":"Emily ONeill","plot":"A hardened detective, haunted by a past betrayal, is forced to confront his demons when a ruthless crime lord offers him a deal: expose a corrupt politician in exchange for the life of his estranged daughter. Torn between his loyalty to the law and his desperate need to save his daughter, the detective must make a choice that will forever alter his fate.  As he delves deeper into the conspiracy, he uncovers a web of deceit and discovers that the true price of loyalty is far greater than he ever imagined."}'),
