ealing.  The line between reality and memory blurs, leaving her to question who she truly is and what she is willing to sacrifice for the truth.',	'poster_126.png',	'{"title":"Sorrows Embrace","runtime_mins":93,"genres":"Drama, Thriller","rating":"4.0","released":2003,"actors":"Hassan Nasrallah,  Leonie Becker","director":"Ho Ho Yin","plot":"A reclusive artist, haunted by a tragic past, finds solace in her art, but her world is shattered when a mysterious stranger arrives, claiming to hold the key to her forgotten memories. As the stranger unravels the secrets of her past, the artist must confront the pain she has buried deep within, ultimately choosing between the comfort of her sorrow and the possibility of healing.  The line between reality and memory blurs, leaving her to question who she truly is and what she is willing to sacrifice for the truth."}'),
