ng his own cynicism and forcing him to confront his own past.  In the process, he discovers the true meaning of unconditional love and the profound impact it can have on the world.',	'poster_128.png',	'{"title":"Unconditional","runtime_mins":133,"genres":"Drama, Thriller","rating":"1.4","released":2002,"actors":"Mei Zhang,  Dhruv Reddy,  Leung Ka Chun","director":"Jakob Weber","plot":"A jaded, cynical journalist, disillusioned by the world''s cruelty, is assigned to write a story about a seemingly ordinary woman who dedicates her life to helping others.  As he delves deeper into her life, he uncovers a tragic past that forced her to embrace unconditional love and forgiveness.  He witnesses firsthand the transformative power of her actions, challenging his own cynicism and forcing him to confront his own past.  In the process, he discovers the true meaning of unconditional love and the profound impact it can have on the world."}'),
