ons threaten to unravel the fabric of reality itself.',	'poster_144.png',	'{"title":"Times Toll","runtime_mins":152,"genres":"Thriller, Fantasy","rating":"4.8","released":2012,"actors":"Jessica Lee","director":"Nabil Ali","plot":"A reclusive clockmaker, haunted by a past tragedy, discovers a mysterious antique clock that seems to manipulate time. As he delves deeper into its secrets, he realizes the clock''s power comes at a terrible cost, forcing him to confront his demons and make a life-altering choice.  The clock''s ticking becomes a race against time as he tries to undo the past, but the consequences of his actions threaten to unravel the fabric of reality itself."}'),
