ocking revelation that threatens to destroy everything he holds dear.',	'poster_168.png',	'{"title":"The Pasts Burden","runtime_mins":174,"genres":"Thriller, Drama","rating":"1.9","released":2000,"actors":"Alice Martini","director":"Jabari Ali","plot":"A successful businessman, haunted by a dark secret from his past, finds his carefully constructed life unraveling when a mysterious woman arrives claiming to know his secret. As he desperately tries to bury the truth, the woman''s relentless pursuit forces him to confront the consequences of his actions.  The line between his present and past blurs, leading to a shocking revelation that threatens to destroy everything he holds dear."}'),
