ront their own lost sense of childlike curiosity.  In the end, Sparky teaches everyone a valuable lesson about the importance of embracing the simple pleasures in life.',	'poster_187.png',	'{"title":"Puppy Principal","runtime_mins":89,"genres":"comedy, kids","rating":"1.2","released":2005,"actors":"Kofi Annan,  Nguyen Van Minh","director":"Enzo Rossi","plot":"When a mischievous puppy named Sparky accidentally gets elected principal of a prestigious elementary school, chaos ensues.  Sparky''s playful antics disrupt the rigid routines, but his genuine love for the students and his ability to see the world through innocent eyes begin to melt the hearts of the jaded staff.  As Sparky''s influence spreads, the school transforms into a place of joy and wonder, forcing the adults to confront their own lost sense of childlike curiosity.  In the end, Sparky teaches everyone a valuable lesson about the importance of embracing the simple pleasures in life."}'),
