h that sets him free.',	'poster_212.png',	'{"actors":"Aarohi Shah","director":"Mohamed Salah","genres":"Drama, Thriller","plot":"A world-renowned mime, known for his silent artistry, suddenly finds himself able to speak.  His newfound voice throws his career into chaos, forcing him to confront the true meaning of his art and the power of silence.  As he struggles to adapt, he uncovers a dark secret about his past that threatens to destroy everything he holds dear.  In a climactic performance, he must choose between the comfort of silence and the truth that sets him free.","rating":"3.1","released":2015,"runtime_mins":51,"title":"The Mime Speaks"}'),
