es and discover the true meaning of friendship.',	'poster_215.png',	'{"actors":"Sofía Rivas,  Daniel OBrien","director":"Emily Chan","genres":"Comedy, Kids","plot":"A pampered poodle named Princess accidentally gets switched with a scruffy stray named Sparky at the dog park.  Princess, now living on the streets, must learn to survive while Sparky enjoys the lap of luxury.  As they navigate their new lives, they realize they both miss their old routines and must find a way to switch back.  But their journey to reunite forces them to confront their own prejudices and discover the true meaning of friendship.","rating":"4.3","released":2022,"runtime_mins":138,"title":"Dog Switch"}'),
