n coexist peacefully. But their friendship is threatened when a greedy hunter sets his sights on capturing Squeaky for profit.',	'poster_218.png',	'{"actors":"Gabriel Torres, John Smith","director":"Amber Perez","genres":"Adventure, Comedy","plot":"A young, curious Sasquatch named Squeaky longs to leave his secluded forest home and explore the world beyond. When he accidentally stumbles upon a bustling human town, he befriends a lonely girl named Lily who helps him navigate the strange new world. Together, they must overcome cultural differences and societal fears to prove that Sasquatch and humans can coexist peacefully. But their friendship is threatened when a greedy hunter sets his sights on capturing Squeaky for profit.","rating":"2.7","released":2010,"runtime_mins":72,"title":"Sasquatch Family"}'),
