ealth lies not in material possessions, but in the bonds of genuine connection.',	'poster_224.png',	'{"actors":"Matteo Rossi","director":"Daniel Costa","genres":"Drama, Comedy","plot":"Four childhood friends, now in their late 30s, win a massive lottery jackpot.  Their lives are turned upside down as they navigate the sudden wealth, facing temptations, betrayals, and the pressure of their newfound fortune.  As their relationships crumble under the strain, they must decide if the money is worth the cost of their friendships.  In the end, they learn that true wealth lies not in material possessions, but in the bonds of genuine connection.","rating":"2.5","released":2010,"runtime_mins":66,"title":"Lottery Winners"}'),
