n critic and creator blurs, and he must decide whether to follow his instincts or succumb to the film''s hypnotic power.',	'poster_232.png',	'{"actors":"Noah Martin,  Henri Schneider,  Julian Sanders","director":"Martín Pereira","genres":"Thriller, Fantasy","plot":"A struggling film critic, desperate for a break, receives an invitation to a mysterious screening. The film is unlike anything he''s ever seen, and he''s tasked with writing a review that will determine its fate. But as he delves deeper into the film''s secrets, he realizes the review might be more dangerous than he imagined.  The line between critic and creator blurs, and he must decide whether to follow his instincts or succumb to the film''s hypnotic power.","rating":"2.8","released":2022,"runtime_mins":43,"title":"The Critics Pick"}'),
