ealize that saying goodbye is never easy, especially when you''re surrounded by the people who know you best.  In the end, they find a way to celebrate their friendship and embrace the bittersweet reality of change.',	'poster_238.png',	'{"actors":"Aarya Iyer","director":"Santiago Fernández","genres":"Comedy, Drama","plot":"A group of lifelong friends, known for their outrageous antics, decide to throw a \"last hurrah\" party before one of them moves to a remote island for a peaceful retirement.  Their plans for a tame farewell quickly spiral out of control as they reminisce about their wild past, leading to a series of hilarious mishaps and unexpected revelations.  As the night unfolds, they realize that saying goodbye is never easy, especially when you''re surrounded by the people who know you best.  In the end, they find a way to celebrate their friendship and embrace the bittersweet reality of change.","rating":"1.0","released":2010,"runtime_mins":36,"title":"A Hilarious Farewell"}'),
