ate.  The friends'' relationships are tested as they face their fears and discover hidden truths about each other.',	'poster_254.png',	'{"actors":"Jason Chow,  Maria Cox","director":"Isabella Martínez","genres":"Thriller, Comedy","plot":"On New Year''s Eve, a group of friends decide to throw a massive party in a luxurious penthouse overlooking the city.  However, their night of revelry takes a chaotic turn when a power outage plunges the building into darkness, trapping them inside with a mysterious intruder.  As the clock ticks down to midnight, they must work together to survive the night and escape the penthouse before it''s too late.  The friends'' relationships are tested as they face their fears and discover hidden truths about each other.","rating":"2.9","released":2016,"runtime_mins":155,"title":"New Years Eve Mayhem"}'),
