 save the day and prove her worth as a planner.  But amidst the chaos, she also discovers a hidden talent for improvisation and a newfound love for the vibrant culture she''s been tasked with celebrating.  In the end, the fiesta becomes a hilarious and heartwarming success',	'poster_259.png',	'{"actors":"Amber Wong,  Chase Brooks","director":"Ji-hyun Lee","genres":"Comedy, Romance","plot":"\"Fiesta Fiasco\" follows a struggling wedding planner, Maria, who is tasked with organizing a lavish, traditional Mexican fiesta for a demanding celebrity couple.  When a series of mishaps, including a runaway piñata, a stolen mariachi band, and a food poisoning scare, threaten to derail the entire event, Maria must use her quick wit and resourcefulness to save the day and prove her worth as a planner.  But amidst the chaos, she also discovers a hidden talent for improvisation and a newfound love for the vibrant culture she''s been tasked with celebrating.  In the end, the fiesta becomes a hilarious and heartwarming success","rating":"1.6","released":2005,"runtime_mins":198,"title":"Fiesta Fiasco"}'),
