 device from falling into the wrong hands, all while battling his own internal demons and a relentless enemy determined to silence him forever.  The fate of the world hangs in the balance as The Agent''s true identity and the secret he holds are revealed in a thrilling climax.',	'poster_300.png',	'{"actors":"Justin Leung","director":"Lee Wai Shan","genres":"Action, Thriller","plot":"A seasoned secret agent, known only as \"The Agent,\" is tasked with retrieving a stolen device capable of controlling global communication networks.  As he delves deeper into the conspiracy, he uncovers a betrayal within his own organization, forcing him to question his loyalties and fight for survival.  The Agent must race against time to expose the traitor and prevent the device from falling into the wrong hands, all while battling his own internal demons and a relentless enemy determined to silence him forever.  The fate of the world hangs in the balance as The Agent''s true identity and the secret he holds are revealed in a thrilling climax.","rating":"4.1","released":2017,"runtime_mins":118,"title":"The Agents Secret"}'),
