angerous agenda.  The line between truth and deception blurs as she fights to save herself and the world from a hidden power.',	'poster_389.png',	'{"actors":"Lau Ho Yin,  Mariana Barros,  Wong Mei Ling","director":"Priya Patel","genres":"Thriller, Adventure","plot":"A brilliant but ostracized college student stumbles upon a secret society dedicated to preserving ancient knowledge.  Drawn into their world of hidden rituals and forbidden texts, she discovers a sinister plot to manipulate the world''s future.  As she delves deeper, she must choose between protecting the society''s secrets or exposing their dangerous agenda.  The line between truth and deception blurs as she fights to save herself and the world from a hidden power.","rating":"4.7","released":2012,"runtime_mins":107,"title":"Secret Society"}'),
