nd danger, forced to confront the consequences of his actions.  The line between art and deception blurs, leaving the audience to question the true value of authenticity.',	'poster_393.png',	'{"actors":"Luka Kovac,  Mariam Diallo","director":"Lauren Baker","genres":"Thriller, Drama","plot":"A renowned art forger, known for his meticulous replicas, is commissioned to create a fake masterpiece for a powerful collector.  However, the forger''s own ambition and a growing sense of guilt lead him to betray the collector, exposing the fraud and jeopardizing his own career.  As the truth unravels, the forger finds himself entangled in a web of deceit and danger, forced to confront the consequences of his actions.  The line between art and deception blurs, leaving the audience to question the true value of authenticity.","rating":"4.0","released":2001,"runtime_mins":30,"title":"Betrayal"}'),
