hat shattered their lives.  Their journey of healing and reconciliation leads them to a surprising truth that changes everything.',	'poster_396.png',	'{"actors":"Anya Kuznetsova,  Chloe Lefevre","director":"Adam Phillips","genres":"Drama, Thriller","plot":"After a tragic accident takes the life of his best friend, Ethan, a talented musician, spirals into self-destruction.  Years later, he receives a letter from the accident''s sole survivor, a young woman named Sarah, who seeks his forgiveness.  Ethan, haunted by guilt and anger, must confront his past and decide whether he can truly forgive himself and Sarah for the events that shattered their lives.  Their journey of healing and reconciliation leads them to a surprising truth that changes everything.","rating":"3.1","released":2018,"runtime_mins":191,"title":"Forgiveness"}');
