ruth leads him on a dangerous path, where he must outsmart a cunning adversary and expose the corruption that threatens to destroy the city.',	'poster_404.png',	'{"actors":"Nikos Papadopoulos","director":"Fatima Said","genres":"Thriller, Action","plot":"A seasoned detective, haunted by a past injustice, is thrust back into the fray when a series of brutal murders mirror a cold case he failed to solve years ago. As he delves deeper, he uncovers a conspiracy that reaches the highest levels of power, forcing him to confront his demons and fight for justice, even if it means risking everything.  His pursuit of truth leads him on a dangerous path, where he must outsmart a cunning adversary and expose the corruption that threatens to destroy the city.","rating":"2.9","released":2013,"runtime_mins":185,"title":"Battle for Justice"}'),
