intentions.  Forced to confront their own inner demons and the harsh realities of their new world, they must fight for their survival and find a way to rebuild a future from the ashes of the past.',	'poster_406.png',	'{"actors":"Tommaso Pellegrini,  Lauren Tse","director":"Ana Dela Cruz","genres":"Action, Thriller","plot":"In a post-apocalyptic world ravaged by a devastating solar flare, a small group of survivors struggle to maintain their humanity amidst dwindling resources and constant threats from mutated creatures.  As they journey across a desolate landscape, they encounter a mysterious stranger who claims to hold the key to their salvation, but their trust is tested when they discover his true intentions.  Forced to confront their own inner demons and the harsh realities of their new world, they must fight for their survival and find a way to rebuild a future from the ashes of the past.","rating":"4.2","released":2021,"runtime_mins":159,"title":"Struggle for Survival"}'),
