he story, questioning his own cynicism and ultimately finding redemption through the power of love.',	'poster_408.png',	'{"actors":"Mei Zhang,  Leymah Gbowee","director":"Neil Desai","genres":"Drama, Romance","plot":"A cynical journalist, jaded by the world''s cruelty, is assigned to cover a story about a small town where a mysterious force seems to be uniting its residents. As he investigates, he discovers the source of this power is an unlikely love story, one that challenges his own beliefs and forces him to confront the transformative potential of human connection.  He finds himself drawn into the story, questioning his own cynicism and ultimately finding redemption through the power of love.","rating":"4.7","released":2008,"runtime_mins":66,"title":"Power of Love"}'),
