t the nature of death and the power of human connection.  In the end, he must confront his own mortality and decide what truly matters in the face of the inevitable.',	'poster_414.png',	'{"actors":"Rory Brennan","director":"Gabriele Moretti","genres":"Thriller, Drama","plot":"A cynical, jaded journalist, disillusioned by life''s meaninglessness, is assigned to write an article about a mysterious cult claiming to have unlocked the secret to death.  As he delves deeper, he finds himself questioning his own beliefs and facing a life-altering choice: embrace the cult''s teachings or cling to his cynical worldview.  His investigation leads him to a hidden truth about the nature of death and the power of human connection.  In the end, he must confront his own mortality and decide what truly matters in the face of the inevitable.","rating":"1.8","released":2015,"runtime_mins":96,"title":"Meaning of Death"}'),
