and unravel the very fabric of her existence.  Ultimately, she must confront her past and make a choice that will determine the fate of both her current and former lives.',	'poster_416.png',	'{"actors":"Ananya Sharma,  Ayman al-Zawahiri,  Callum McCarthy","director":"Omar Sharif","genres":"Fantasy, Thriller","plot":"A young woman, haunted by recurring dreams of a life she never lived, discovers she''s been reincarnated.  Driven by a mysterious pull, she embarks on a journey to uncover the truth behind her past life, encountering both danger and unexpected allies along the way.  As she delves deeper, she uncovers a dark secret that threatens to shatter her present life and unravel the very fabric of her existence.  Ultimately, she must confront her past and make a choice that will determine the fate of both her current and former lives.","rating":"1.7","released":2021,"runtime_mins":176,"title":"Reincarnation"}'),
