becomes the very thing he fears.  His desperate search for a solution leads him to confront the ethical implications of his actions and the true meaning of humanity.',	'poster_421.png',	'{"actors":"Nikos Papadopoulos,  Aroha Jones","director":"Erica Cooper","genres":"Horror, Thriller","plot":"A brilliant but reclusive scientist, driven by a desire to cure his terminally ill daughter, accidentally unlocks a gene-altering formula.  The formula grants him superhuman abilities, but at a terrible cost: he slowly transforms into a monstrous creature.  As his transformation progresses, he must race against time to find a cure before he loses himself completely and becomes the very thing he fears.  His desperate search for a solution leads him to confront the ethical implications of his actions and the true meaning of humanity.","rating":"3.0","released":2002,"runtime_mins":153,"title":"Transformation"}'),
