ns of his own prophecy.  As the sun begins to show signs of instability, the world descends into chaos, forcing him to confront the ultimate question: can humanity be saved from its own fate?',	'poster_426.png',	'{"actors":"Vihaan Kapoor","director":"Sonali Chatterjee","genres":"Thriller, Science Fiction","plot":"A reclusive astrophysicist discovers a cryptic message hidden within the cosmic microwave background radiation, predicting a catastrophic solar flare that will engulf Earth in a fiery apocalypse.  Desperate to warn humanity, he must race against time to decipher the message and convince a skeptical world of the impending doom, while grappling with the devastating implications of his own prophecy.  As the sun begins to show signs of instability, the world descends into chaos, forcing him to confront the ultimate question: can humanity be saved from its own fate?","rating":"4.6","released":2022,"runtime_mins":187,"title":"Prophecy"}'),
