 fragmented memories and choose between two lives, one familiar and one filled with potential.  But the clock''s power comes with a price, and she must decide if the echoes of time are worth the risk.',	'poster_579.png',	'{"actors":"Victoria Bailey,  Aditya Sharma","director":"Nicholas Cheng","genres":"Fantasy, Thriller","plot":"A young woman, haunted by recurring dreams of a life she doesn''t remember, discovers a hidden family secret that leads her to a mysterious antique clock.  When she touches the clock, she''s transported to a parallel world where she''s a renowned artist, but her past life is a blur.  As she navigates this new reality, she must unravel the truth behind her fragmented memories and choose between two lives, one familiar and one filled with potential.  But the clock''s power comes with a price, and she must decide if the echoes of time are worth the risk.","rating":"4.6","released":2021,"runtime_mins":78,"title":"Lost in Echoes of Time"}'),
