ncient curses, and a mysterious cult seeking to exploit the pharaoh''s power for their own sinister purposes.  Evelyn must confront her own past and make a difficult choice to save the world from an ancient evil.',	'poster_600.png',	'{"actors":"Diya Singh","director":"Valentina Gómez","genres":"Action, Adventure","plot":"A team of archaeologists, led by the brilliant but reckless Dr. Evelyn Carter, discovers a hidden tomb deep in the Egyptian desert.  They soon realize the tomb is not just a burial site, but a gateway to a powerful ancient magic, and they must race against time to stop a malevolent force from being unleashed.  As the team delves deeper into the tomb, they encounter deadly traps, ancient curses, and a mysterious cult seeking to exploit the pharaoh''s power for their own sinister purposes.  Evelyn must confront her own past and make a difficult choice to save the world from an ancient evil.","rating":"3.7","released":2002,"runtime_mins":89,"title":"Tomb of the Forgotten Pharaoh"}'),
