hat she expected, and she must choose between protecting its secrets or unleashing its true potential.  The fate of the world hangs in the balance as she races against time to decipher the ancient riddle and decide the Grail''s destiny.',	'poster_608.png',	'{"actors":"Clara Werner,  Maximilian Weber","director":"Sameer Khan","genres":"Adventure, Thriller","plot":"A young historian, obsessed with the legend of the Holy Grail, stumbles upon a cryptic clue hidden within an ancient manuscript.  Following the trail, she finds herself in a remote, forgotten monastery where she uncovers a secret society dedicated to protecting the Grail''s true location.  As she delves deeper, she realizes the Grail''s power is not what she expected, and she must choose between protecting its secrets or unleashing its true potential.  The fate of the world hangs in the balance as she races against time to decipher the ancient riddle and decide the Grail''s destiny.","rating":"4.4","released":2014,"runtime_mins":37,"title":"Secret of the Holy Grail"}'),
