me him.  As the lines between past and present blur, the archaeologist discovers a hidden truth about Alexander''s legacy and the true power of the sword.  Ultimately, the fate of the world rests on the archaeologist''s ability to confront his own inner demons and make a choice that will determine the future.',	'poster_632.png',	'{"actors":"Mia Bauer,  Hanna Hoffmann","director":"Shania Yazzie","genres":"Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Historical, Thriller","plot":"A young archaeologist stumbles upon the legendary sword of Alexander the Great, unleashing a powerful curse that brings the ancient warrior back to life.  Now, the archaeologist must race against time to stop Alexander from conquering the modern world, while also battling the curse that threatens to consume him.  As the lines between past and present blur, the archaeologist discovers a hidden truth about Alexander''s legacy and the true power of the sword.  Ultimately, the fate of the world rests on the archaeologist''s ability to confront his own inner demons and make a choice that will determine the future.","rating":"2.7","released":2016,"runtime_mins":54,"title":"Sword of Alexander the Great"}'),
