clipse consumes them all.  Her journey leads her to a hidden temple where she discovers a forgotten prophecy and a powerful artifact that can banish the spirits, but only if she can overcome her own inner darkness.',	'poster_666.png',	'{"actors":"Mateo Hernández, Alexander Müller,  Gabriel Torres","director":"Lau Wing Sze","genres":"Horror, Fantasy","plot":"A remote village is terrorized by a series of crimson eclipses, each bringing with it a malevolent spirit that preys on the villagers'' deepest fears. A young woman, haunted by a tragic past, must confront her own demons and unlock the ancient secrets of the eclipses to save her community before the final, devastating eclipse consumes them all.  Her journey leads her to a hidden temple where she discovers a forgotten prophecy and a powerful artifact that can banish the spirits, but only if she can overcome her own inner darkness.","rating":"1.4","released":2015,"runtime_mins":136,"title":"The Crimson Eclipses Curse"}'),
