r more sinister than she could have imagined.  As she unravels the city''s dark history, she must choose between her own ambition and the fate of the world.',	'poster_669.png',	'{"actors":"Chloe Lefevre","director":"Leonardo da Silva","genres":"Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Thriller","plot":"A young archaeologist, driven by a thirst for forbidden knowledge, stumbles upon a hidden map leading to the legendary city of Azarath, said to be cursed by ancient gods.  Ignoring warnings of its deadly secrets, she embarks on a perilous journey, facing treacherous traps and monstrous guardians, only to discover the city''s true purpose is far more sinister than she could have imagined.  As she unravels the city''s dark history, she must choose between her own ambition and the fate of the world.","rating":"1.7","released":2003,"runtime_mins":121,"title":"Azaraths Forbidden City"}'),
