e prophecy and prevent a catastrophic event, while battling a shadowy organization seeking to exploit the artifact for their own sinister purposes.',	'poster_682.png',	'{"actors":"George Wilson,  Diya Singh","director":"Fela Kuti","genres":"Action, Adventure, Thriller","plot":"Dr. Amelia Carter, a brilliant Egyptologist, discovers a hidden chamber within the Great Sphinx, containing an ancient artifact that unlocks a forgotten language. As she deciphers the cryptic text, she uncovers a shocking truth about the Sphinx''s origins and a hidden prophecy that threatens the world. Now, Amelia must race against time to decipher the prophecy and prevent a catastrophic event, while battling a shadowy organization seeking to exploit the artifact for their own sinister purposes.","rating":"1.4","released":2010,"runtime_mins":160,"title":"Unraveling the Sphinx"}'),
