ning of faith and the power of belief, as he uncovers the Lance''s true legacy.',	'poster_698.png',	'{"actors":"Reyansh Desai","director":"Valentina Gómez","genres":"Action, Adventure, Historical, Thriller","plot":"A reclusive historian, obsessed with the legend of the Holy Lance, discovers a hidden map leading to its supposed resting place.  He embarks on a perilous journey across Europe, facing both historical and modern dangers, to find the artifact.  His quest is complicated by a rival treasure hunter, who seeks the Lance for his own nefarious purposes.  In the end, the historian must confront the true meaning of faith and the power of belief, as he uncovers the Lance''s true legacy.","rating":"4.7","released":2000,"runtime_mins":187,"title":"Holy Lance Legend"}'),
