with the future of humanity, and they must make a choice that could alter the course of history.  The team must decide whether to protect the secrets of Thule or share them with the world, risking the consequences of unleashing ancient knowledge.',	'poster_735.png',	'{"actors":"Siya Shah,  Katerina Smirnova","director":"Sara Monti","genres":"Adventure, Action","plot":"A team of archaeologists, led by a maverick professor, discovers a hidden map leading to the mythical lost continent of Thule.  Their expedition faces treacherous conditions and ancient guardians as they race against time to uncover the truth behind Thule''s disappearance and the secrets it holds.  As they delve deeper, they realize the continent''s fate is intertwined with the future of humanity, and they must make a choice that could alter the course of history.  The team must decide whether to protect the secrets of Thule or share them with the world, risking the consequences of unleashing ancient knowledge.","rating":"2.8","released":2022,"runtime_mins":152,"title":"Thule: The Lost Continent"}'),
