ily must race against time to uncover the truth and break the curse before it''s too late, all while trying to keep her own werewolf identity hidden.  With a dash of romance and a whole lot of mayhem, Lily''s journey becomes a whirlwind of unexpected twists and turns.',	'poster_783.png',	'{"actors":"Ng Wing Ki,  Gael Mendoza,  Chutimon Thepcharoen","director":"Fatima Said","genres":"fantasy, comedy","plot":"Lily, a wedding planner with a secret past, is tasked with organizing five lavish weddings in a small town.  As she navigates the chaos of love, drama, and demanding brides, she discovers a dark secret about the town''s history - a werewolf curse that threatens to disrupt the festivities.  Lily must race against time to uncover the truth and break the curse before it''s too late, all while trying to keep her own werewolf identity hidden.  With a dash of romance and a whole lot of mayhem, Lily''s journey becomes a whirlwind of unexpected twists and turns.","rating":"2.5","released":2008,"runtime_mins":124,"title":"Five Weddings and a Werewolf (because Even Fairytales Need a Twist)"}'),
