ed wedding become a symbol of their collective cold feet?  In the end, they learn that true love isn''t always about the perfect wedding, but about the journey they take together.',	'poster_791.png',	'{"actors":"Jonathan Edwards","director":"Aaliyah Hassan","genres":"comedy, romance","plot":"After years of friendship, the \"My Best Friends Wedding\" crew is finally getting married - all at the same time!  But as the big day approaches, each couple starts to have second thoughts, leading to a whirlwind of pre-wedding chaos, hilarious mishaps, and heartfelt confessions.  Will they all make it to the altar, or will their shared wedding become a symbol of their collective cold feet?  In the end, they learn that true love isn''t always about the perfect wedding, but about the journey they take together.","rating":"3.2","released":2006,"runtime_mins":148,"title":"My Best Friends Wedding 6: The Wedding Where Everyone Gets Cold Feet"}'),
