 down and risk losing everything.  In the process, he learns a valuable lesson about the power of words and the importance of responsibility.',	'poster_802.png',	'{"actors":"Lam Mei Ling,  Ananya Sharma,  Maria Cruz","director":"Fionn Daly","genres":"Drama, Comedy","plot":"A stand-up comedian, known for his edgy humor, faces backlash after a joke about a sensitive topic goes viral.  His career plummets, and he''s forced to confront the consequences of his words.  As he navigates the public outcry and grapples with his own guilt, he must decide whether to apologize and risk losing his comedic voice, or double down and risk losing everything.  In the process, he learns a valuable lesson about the power of words and the importance of responsibility.","rating":"2.7","released":2008,"runtime_mins":55,"title":"But It Sounds Funny)"}'),
