ens to destroy their newfound paradise, Barnaby and his flock must use their cloud-surfing skills to save their home and prove that counting sheep can be anything but boring.  Along the way, they learn the importance of friendship, courage, and the power of imagination.',	'',	'{"actors":"Camila Sánchez,  Tawakkol Karman,  Crystal Cook","director":"Ana Dela Cruz","genres":"kids, fantasy, adventure, comedy","plot":"Barnaby, a sheep with an insatiable curiosity, discovers a magical cloud that allows him to surf the skies.  He soon gathers a flock of friends, each with their own unique cloud-surfing style, and they embark on thrilling adventures across the countryside.  But when a grumpy farmer threatens to destroy their newfound paradise, Barnaby and his flock must use their cloud-surfing skills to save their home and prove that counting sheep can be anything but boring.  Along the way, they learn the importance of friendship, courage, and the power of imagination.","rating":"1.5","released":2015,"runtime_mins":85,"title":"The Cloud-Surfing Sheep: Counting Sheep Has Never Been So Fun"}'),
