ty form an unlikely bond, embarking on a hilarious journey to find a way to reverse the spell and return Sparkle to his home.  Along the way, they encounter a cast of eccentric characters and learn that even the most unlikely friendships can blossom in the most unexpected places.',	'poster_814.png',	'{"actors":"Jamila Ibrahim,  Khaled Hosseini,  Julian Sanders","director":"Jennifer Rivera","genres":"Comedy, Fantasy","plot":"Sparkle, a magical unicorn with a penchant for mischief, finds himself banished from the enchanted forest after accidentally turning the King''s beard pink.  He lands in a dusty antique shop, where he meets Dusty, a neglected vacuum cleaner yearning for adventure.  Despite their differences, Sparkle and Dusty form an unlikely bond, embarking on a hilarious journey to find a way to reverse the spell and return Sparkle to his home.  Along the way, they encounter a cast of eccentric characters and learn that even the most unlikely friendships can blossom in the most unexpected places.","rating":"2.0","released":2016,"runtime_mins":56,"title":"The Unlikely Friendship Between a Unicorn and a Vacuum Cleaner (Because Opposites Attract)"}'),
