ical intrigue, penguin gossip, and the looming threat of a hungry leopard seal to secure his place as the new ruler of the iceberg.  Will Pip''s idealism and passion for change be enough to win over the colony and lead them to a brighter future?',	'',	'{"actors":"Emma Ferreira","director":"Isabella Martínez","genres":"Comedy, Adventure","plot":"In a bustling penguin colony, a young, ambitious penguin named Pip dreams of becoming the next leader.  When the current Emperor Penguin, a wise but aging patriarch, announces his retirement, Pip throws his flipper into the ring, facing off against a formidable rival, the cunning and charismatic Percy.  As the election heats up, Pip must navigate political intrigue, penguin gossip, and the looming threat of a hungry leopard seal to secure his place as the new ruler of the iceberg.  Will Pip''s idealism and passion for change be enough to win over the colony and lead them to a brighter future?","rating":"3.4","released":2013,"runtime_mins":103,"title":"The Penguin Parliament: Ruling the Iceberg with Flippers"}'),
