 the importance of connecting with others on a deeper level, even without words.  Ultimately, Milo learns that true artistry lies not in conformity, but in embracing his own individuality and finding his voice, however unconventional it may be.',	'poster_820.png',	'{"actors":"David Brown,  Gabriel Russell","director":"Nilak Butler","genres":"drama, comedy","plot":"Milo, a talented but disillusioned mime, drops out of the prestigious Mime Academy, feeling stifled by its rigid traditions.  He embarks on a journey to find his own unique voice, using his mime skills to navigate the chaotic world of street performance and unexpected encounters.  Along the way, he discovers the power of silence and the importance of connecting with others on a deeper level, even without words.  Ultimately, Milo learns that true artistry lies not in conformity, but in embracing his own individuality and finding his voice, however unconventional it may be.","rating":"4.2","released":2003,"runtime_mins":136,"title":"The Mime School Dropout: Finding His Voice (Without Words)"}'),
