s the true meaning of sacrifice and the power of hope.  In a climactic battle, he must decide whether to embrace his destiny or defy it, ultimately shaping the fate of both dragons and humanity.',	'poster_833.png',	'{"actors":"Ananya Sharma","director":"Thiago Oliveira","genres":"Fantasy, Action","plot":"A young warrior, burdened by a prophecy foretelling the end of dragons, must confront his own inner demons and a powerful sorcerer who seeks to extinguish the last dragonfire.  As the world teeters on the brink of darkness, he must choose between fulfilling the prophecy and saving the creature he has come to love.  His journey leads him to a hidden sanctuary where he discovers the true meaning of sacrifice and the power of hope.  In a climactic battle, he must decide whether to embrace his destiny or defy it, ultimately shaping the fate of both dragons and humanity.","rating":"3.2","released":2006,"runtime_mins":39,"title":"Dragonfires End"}'),
