's power becomes a dangerous temptation, leading her to question whether she can truly control her own fate or if it''s already been predetermined.  In a race against time, she must find a way to undo the damage she''s caused before it''',	'poster_849.png',	'{"actors":"Jose Gonzalez","director":"Matthew Martin","genres":"fantasy, thriller","plot":"\"Fates Intertwined\" follows a struggling artist who discovers a mysterious antique clock that grants wishes, but at a terrible cost.  As she uses the clock to achieve her dreams, she unwittingly sets in motion a chain of events that unravels the lives of those around her, forcing her to confront the consequences of her actions and the true meaning of destiny.  The clock''s power becomes a dangerous temptation, leading her to question whether she can truly control her own fate or if it''s already been predetermined.  In a race against time, she must find a way to undo the damage she''s caused before it''","rating":"1.0","released":2020,"runtime_mins":53,"title":"Fates Intertwined"}'),
