y forces him to confront the harsh realities of the divided world and the true meaning of hope.',	'poster_869.png',	'{"actors":"Rory Brennan,  Madison Hughes,  Lee Ka Yan","director":"Benjamin Schulz","genres":"Action, Sci-Fi","plot":"In a dystopian future, Earth is ravaged by climate change and overpopulation, while a select few live in luxury on a space station called Elysium. A desperate man, driven by the need to save his dying daughter, infiltrates Elysium through a hidden portal, \"Elysium''s Gate,\" sparking a rebellion against the oppressive elite and a fight for a better future for all.  His journey forces him to confront the harsh realities of the divided world and the true meaning of hope.","rating":"3.8","released":2019,"runtime_mins":34,"title":"Elysiums Gate"}'),
