e it claims more victims.  The line between past and present blurs as she fights to break free from the echoes of a haunting past.',	'poster_879.png',	'{"actors":"Ana Clara Silva,  Chris Leung,  Mary Johnson","director":"Amina Mohamed","genres":"Horror, Thriller","plot":"A reclusive antique dealer, haunted by a mysterious past, discovers a hidden compartment in a vintage music box.  As she unlocks its secrets, she unwittingly unleashes a malevolent spirit that seeks revenge for a long-forgotten tragedy.  Forced to confront her own buried memories, she must unravel the truth behind the music box and stop the vengeful spirit before it claims more victims.  The line between past and present blurs as she fights to break free from the echoes of a haunting past.","rating":"1.9","released":2010,"runtime_mins":150,"title":"Echoes of the Past"}'),
