in future.  As Anya delves deeper, she uncovers a sinister plot that threatens to manipulate the lives of everyone connected to the technology, forcing her to make a life-altering decision that will shape the future of humanity.',	'poster_880.png',	'{"actors":"Evan Perry,  Fiona Gallagher,  Lam Siu Mei","director":"Jason Mitchell","genres":"Thriller, Sci-Fi","plot":"In a world where people can access their future selves through a revolutionary technology, a young woman named Anya discovers a chilling truth about her own future. Determined to change her fate, she embarks on a perilous journey to unravel the secrets behind the technology, facing both internal and external conflicts as she struggles to reconcile her present with her uncertain future.  As Anya delves deeper, she uncovers a sinister plot that threatens to manipulate the lives of everyone connected to the technology, forcing her to make a life-altering decision that will shape the future of humanity.","rating":"2.1","released":2005,"runtime_mins":68,"title":"Futures Embrace"}'),
