ng but reckless astrophysicist, forming an unlikely alliance to save the world.  Their journey takes them through wormholes, parallel dimensions, and the very heart of a black hole, forcing them to confront their own fears and the true',	'poster_883.png',	'{"actors":"Elizabeth Graham","director":"Victoria Ross","genres":"Action, Sci-Fi","plot":"A brilliant but reclusive inventor, Dr. Anya Petrova, discovers a way to manipulate the fabric of space-time using a device she calls the \"Cosmic Cogs.\"  When a rogue scientist steals the technology, Anya must race against time to stop him from unleashing a catastrophic singularity that threatens to consume the universe.  Along the way, she teams up with a cynical but skilled hacker and a charming but reckless astrophysicist, forming an unlikely alliance to save the world.  Their journey takes them through wormholes, parallel dimensions, and the very heart of a black hole, forcing them to confront their own fears and the true","rating":"4.2","released":2022,"runtime_mins":73,"title":"Cosmic Cogs"}'),
