l torment.  With their hope dwindling, they must find a way to escape before they become prisoners of Hell itself.',	'poster_901.png',	'{"actors":"Chase Brooks,  Sean OConnor","director":"Aisha Hussein","genres":"Horror, Adventure","plot":"A group of thrill-seeking explorers venture into a remote, uncharted cave system rumored to be the entrance to Hell.  As they descend deeper, they encounter terrifying creatures and ancient curses, pushing them to their physical and mental limits.  Their descent into the abyss becomes a desperate fight for survival as they realize the legends are true, and they are trapped in a realm of eternal torment.  With their hope dwindling, they must find a way to escape before they become prisoners of Hell itself.","rating":"1.5","released":2015,"runtime_mins":152,"title":"Hells Abyss"}'),
